      <p><seg source="#source-472-478">先づ</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-478-511">〻</g><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-511-544">〻</g><seg source="#source-544-615">御無事とぞんじ上候。天下の時勢切迫致し候に付、</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-615-755" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p><seg source="#source-650-670">一、高マチ袴</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-670-696">一、ブツサキ羽織</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-696-719">一、宗十郎頭巾</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><seg source="#source-757-828">外に細き大小一腰各々一ツ、御用意あり度存上候。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-828-908" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-849-864">九月十三日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-864-908" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(1)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=1"><seg source="#source-894-908">坂本龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-908-947" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <p><seg source="#source-929-947">平井かほどの</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
